<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13355" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποξύω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῡ</span>], fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ξύσω,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποξέω</span>
			, <i>scrape off,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				9.4.4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν καττίτερον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					7.303.15
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Oropus</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				5.79
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάρμακον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.Chr.
					32.44
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i>scrape oneself,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				34.62
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>strip off</i> as it were a skin, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆρας ἀποξύσας θήσει νέον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					9.446
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Nosti
				<u>Fr.</u>
				6
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόρυζαν ἀποξύσας</span> (prob. 
				f.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπομύξας</span>
			) <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Nav.</u>
				45
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἐρυθριᾶν ἀ. τοῦ προσώπου</span>
			v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Vit.Auct.</u>
				10
			</span></i>: so in 
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπέξυσται τὴν αἰδῶ τοῦ προσώπου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alciphr.
					3.40
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <i>scrape off,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάρμακον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.Chr.
					32.44
				</span></i>
			.</div>
